WEBVTT

00:00:20.680 --> 00:00:21.930
Yusei.

00:00:23.340 --> 00:00:24.760
I'm praying for your success.

00:00:24.760 --> 00:00:26.610
I know you can do it.

00:00:26.610 --> 00:00:31.100
Now that you've come this far, I 
won't say anything anymore.  Go!

00:00:31.100 --> 00:00:33.010
And when you meet Jack…

00:00:33.010 --> 00:00:36.370
Well, whatever.  Come 
home as soon as possible.

00:00:36.370 --> 00:00:38.300
Oh, wait!

00:00:39.870 --> 00:00:42.300
Here's a good luck charm.

00:00:43.480 --> 00:00:44.730
This is…

00:00:44.730 --> 00:00:46.720
Turbo Booster.

00:00:47.770 --> 00:00:49.530
But you love this.

00:00:49.760 --> 00:00:52.340
Yeah, but it's fine.

00:00:52.370 --> 00:00:55.690
Use it to get through that pipeline.

00:01:05.500 --> 00:01:07.010
I promise to return it.

00:01:08.310 --> 00:01:09.810
Do your best.

00:01:16.380 --> 00:01:17.540
Yusei!

00:01:17.570 --> 00:01:19.270
Do your best!

00:01:46.230 --> 00:01:51.480
No matter how far apart we 
are, we can’t be stopped

00:01:51.600 --> 00:01:56.540
That’s deeply engraved into us

00:01:56.670 --> 00:02:05.080
So don’t be afraid of getting hurt

00:02:07.450 --> 00:02:11.020
Break through even further

00:02:11.380 --> 00:02:16.560
While carrying your beliefs in your heart

00:02:17.990 --> 00:02:23.670
There’s always only one truth

00:02:23.830 --> 00:02:27.530
So feel the voice of your heart

00:02:28.770 --> 00:02:32.340
With your unwavering emotions,

00:02:32.780 --> 00:02:38.450
Seize the signs of tomorrow

00:03:07.890 --> 00:03:13.290
Escape!  Nitro Warrior vs. Goyo Guardian!

00:03:21.260 --> 00:03:22.680
This signal!

00:03:23.230 --> 00:03:26.300
The same D-Wheel as before has appeared!

00:03:26.300 --> 00:03:27.510
What?

00:03:27.510 --> 00:03:30.200
I'm going to switch to the 
rooftop camera right now.

00:03:32.430 --> 00:03:36.390
Alright!  Continue the pursuit!  
Don't lose sight of him!

00:03:38.130 --> 00:03:40.390
Transfer all information to me!

00:03:42.620 --> 00:03:47.190
Damn!  I don't know where he's 
planning to go, but this time…

00:03:47.590 --> 00:03:49.270
I'll squash him!

00:04:01.770 --> 00:04:04.430
Look at the time already.  Let's hurry.

00:04:13.810 --> 00:04:15.200
Where's Yusei?

00:04:15.200 --> 00:04:17.160
Look.  There he is.

00:04:20.290 --> 00:04:21.680
This is a warning.

00:04:21.680 --> 00:04:24.110
You are not allowed to come any closer.

00:04:24.110 --> 00:04:25.900
Turn back right now.

00:04:34.060 --> 00:04:36.030
We meet again, you piece of garbage.

00:04:36.030 --> 00:04:39.590
A punk like you is not allowed to come here!

00:04:39.590 --> 00:04:41.150
Leave!

00:04:43.700 --> 00:04:46.590
What is that punk planning to do?

00:04:47.510 --> 00:04:49.540
He can't be…

00:05:00.770 --> 00:05:04.560
Control!  Hurry up and 
open the plant's fences!

00:05:09.010 --> 00:05:13.320
Damn that punk!  I won't let him escape!

00:05:16.770 --> 00:05:19.000
Security is chasing after him!

00:05:19.000 --> 00:05:20.760
Go, Yusei!

00:05:25.820 --> 00:05:30.890
This location is the perfect place 
to use the special pursuit deck!

00:05:31.990 --> 00:05:34.710
I forcibly activate a Field Spell!

00:05:34.710 --> 00:05:36.560
Speed World!

00:05:38.120 --> 00:05:41.420
Duel mode on.  Autopilot standby.

00:05:44.890 --> 00:05:46.080
What?

00:05:47.230 --> 00:05:51.050
Duel mode on.  Autopilot standby.

00:05:53.080 --> 00:05:54.500
What is that?

00:05:54.500 --> 00:05:55.860
A Field Spell?

00:05:55.860 --> 00:05:57.940
There's no time to duel!

00:06:01.270 --> 00:06:08.960
How's that!  This connects with Speed World 
and pulls the opponent into the Field Spell!

00:06:08.960 --> 00:06:11.690
I don't know where you're 
planning to go, but if you

00:06:11.690 --> 00:06:14.690
want to keep going forward, 
then you have to battle me!

00:06:14.980 --> 00:06:16.230
Duel!

00:06:20.420 --> 00:06:22.160
I go first!

00:06:22.710 --> 00:06:25.800
I summon Gate Blocker in defense position!

00:06:33.040 --> 00:06:35.760
Now he won't be able to increase his speed!

00:06:35.760 --> 00:06:37.610
He won't make it in time!

00:06:37.610 --> 00:06:41.690
Then I set a card and end my turn.

00:06:45.770 --> 00:06:50.510
Kid, it looks like your Speed 
Counters aren't increasing.

00:06:53.810 --> 00:07:00.040
Normally, when the Field 
Spell Speed World is active,

00:07:00.040 --> 00:07:05.040
we gain a Speed Counter 
during each Standby Phase.

00:07:05.040 --> 00:07:13.780
However, when Gate Blocker is faceup on the 
field, you don't receive the effect of Speed World!

00:07:13.780 --> 00:07:16.580
Therefore, your Speed Spells are…

00:07:16.580 --> 00:07:18.230
…sealed away.

00:07:19.360 --> 00:07:23.000
This is an incredible monster 
that greatly sways the

00:07:23.000 --> 00:07:26.130
balance of a duel, so it has 
limits on when it can be used.

00:07:26.130 --> 00:07:30.000
However, my deck is a special deck that 
has received special security privileges,

00:07:30.000 --> 00:07:32.990
so I can freely use Gate Blocker!

00:07:32.990 --> 00:07:35.830
You can't escape from me anymore.

00:07:36.350 --> 00:07:38.310
So that's the power of authority.

00:07:44.620 --> 00:07:46.410
It's midnight!

00:07:46.910 --> 00:07:49.160
He only has three minutes!

00:07:49.160 --> 00:07:52.320
At this rate, he'll be caught 
while he's still dueling!

00:07:52.320 --> 00:07:55.040
Yusei!  Break down that wall!

00:07:57.270 --> 00:07:58.770
I don't like this.

00:08:01.060 --> 00:08:02.650
I don't like this.

00:08:02.820 --> 00:08:03.780
I'm...

00:08:05.280 --> 00:08:06.840
...going forward!

00:08:09.500 --> 00:08:10.580
Yusei!

00:08:10.170 --> 00:08:11.590
Go!

00:08:11.590 --> 00:08:12.720
My turn.

00:08:13.120 --> 00:08:15.640
I summon Speed Warrior!

00:08:22.700 --> 00:08:28.220
I remember that on the turn that it's 
summoned, its attack points are doubled during battle.

00:08:28.220 --> 00:08:32.940
But that's not good enough.  It's still 
less than Gate Blocker's defense points!

00:08:37.480 --> 00:08:41.130
Rally, I'm going to use your lucky charm.

00:08:41.880 --> 00:08:45.990
Then from my hand, I Special 
Summon Turbo Booster.

00:08:50.390 --> 00:08:53.020
It appeared!  It's Turbo Booster!

00:08:53.020 --> 00:08:54.180
Battle!

00:08:59.210 --> 00:09:01.410
I release Turbo Booster.

00:09:02.390 --> 00:09:04.800
So you're even willing to do that.

00:09:04.880 --> 00:09:08.850
Releasing Turbo Booster has that much value.

00:09:08.910 --> 00:09:12.960
He fired Speed Warrior using Turbo Booster.

00:09:13.130 --> 00:09:16.800
Turbo Booster's monster effect 
destroys one Normal Summoned monster

00:09:16.800 --> 00:09:20.800
and the opponent's monster that it battled!

00:09:20.800 --> 00:09:22.160
This will work!

00:09:23.530 --> 00:09:25.330
Not good enough!

00:09:25.330 --> 00:09:30.310
Even if you destroy Gate Blocker, Gate 
Blocker has greater defense points!

00:09:30.310 --> 00:09:33.560
The damage is going to come 
back and hurt your life points!

00:09:36.010 --> 00:09:37.240
I'll still do it!

00:09:41.400 --> 00:09:43.760
He did it!

00:09:43.760 --> 00:09:45.860
Thank you, Turbo Booster!

00:09:45.860 --> 00:09:47.500
Go, Yusei!

00:09:51.280 --> 00:09:55.470
Rally, thanks to you, I can go forward.

00:09:57.850 --> 00:09:59.210
He entered!

00:10:00.050 --> 00:10:01.910
That punk!

00:10:01.910 --> 00:10:04.480
Is he planning to escape from Satellite?

00:10:04.480 --> 00:10:07.130
That garbage doesn't know his place.

00:10:07.330 --> 00:10:10.050
Hey, that Security guy also entered!

00:10:10.050 --> 00:10:11.440
They're going to duel inside?

00:10:11.440 --> 00:10:14.560
This is bad!  Hurry up and finish him, Yusei!

00:10:16.750 --> 00:10:18.990
I won't let you escape!

00:10:18.990 --> 00:10:22.110
I activate the trap card Broken Blocker!

00:10:27.750 --> 00:10:29.720
He still had more.

00:10:30.110 --> 00:10:34.760
I can activate Broken Blocker when 
a monster in defense position

00:10:34.760 --> 00:10:37.760
whose defense points are greater 
than its attack points is destroyed!

00:10:37.760 --> 00:10:40.670
I can Special Summon two 
monsters from my deck whose

00:10:40.670 --> 00:10:43.670
names are the same as the 
monster that was destroyed!

00:10:43.670 --> 00:10:46.960
See that!  This is what 
authority is all about!

00:10:47.720 --> 00:10:51.580
I set two cards and end my turn.

00:10:51.690 --> 00:10:54.760
There are only two minutes left!  
What are you going to do, Yusei?

00:10:54.760 --> 00:10:56.080
He's fine!

00:10:56.210 --> 00:10:58.650
Yusei is going to turn the tables!

00:10:58.750 --> 00:11:01.490
But there's less than two minutes left!

00:11:01.490 --> 00:11:04.330
He's going much slower than 
during the simulation!

00:11:08.580 --> 00:11:10.270
My turn.

00:11:31.770 --> 00:11:33.400
My turn.

00:11:33.400 --> 00:11:37.660
I summon Gonogo in attack position!

00:11:40.970 --> 00:11:43.040
Go, Gonogo!

00:11:43.040 --> 00:11:44.830
Death Flat!

00:11:52.770 --> 00:11:54.630
Hey!

00:11:54.630 --> 00:11:56.660
There's no place to escape!

00:11:58.590 --> 00:11:59.830
Yusei!

00:12:01.680 --> 00:12:03.310
My turn.

00:12:04.880 --> 00:12:06.140
It's here.

00:12:06.490 --> 00:12:10.190
I summon the Tuner Monster Junk Synchron!

00:12:12.530 --> 00:12:16.390
Then I reveal the Continuous 
Trap Graceful Revival!

00:12:16.390 --> 00:12:18.500
What's happening?

00:12:18.500 --> 00:12:21.860
With this, I can Special Summon 
one Level 2-or-below monster

00:12:21.860 --> 00:12:24.860
from my graveyard in attack position.

00:12:24.860 --> 00:12:28.270
Come, Level 2 monster Speed Warrior!

00:12:34.570 --> 00:12:37.900
Junk Synchron tunes Speed Warrior!

00:12:43.190 --> 00:12:47.100
The stars come together 
to call forth a new power!

00:12:47.100 --> 00:12:49.470
Become the path that lights the way!

00:12:52.570 --> 00:12:54.300
Synchro Summon!

00:12:55.230 --> 00:12:57.690
Come, Junk Warrior!

00:13:03.130 --> 00:13:06.190
Alright!  He successfully 
summoned Junk Warrior!

00:13:06.200 --> 00:13:08.970
I'm counting on you, Junk Warrior.

00:13:13.630 --> 00:13:15.540
Scrap Fist!

00:13:20.690 --> 00:13:23.300
I already know your strategies!

00:13:23.300 --> 00:13:26.070
It's now going to start getting interesting!

00:13:26.870 --> 00:13:28.460
My turn!

00:13:29.350 --> 00:13:32.730
I summon Jutte Fighter!

00:13:34.410 --> 00:13:35.700
That's a Tuner.

00:13:35.740 --> 00:13:40.220
That's right!  I can Synchro Summon too!

00:13:40.400 --> 00:13:41.790
Here I go.

00:13:47.750 --> 00:13:51.420
Jutte Fighter tunes Gate Blocker!

00:13:51.830 --> 00:13:54.000
Synchro Summon!

00:13:54.660 --> 00:13:57.270
Goyo Guardian!

00:13:59.670 --> 00:14:02.170
See that!  This is authority!

00:14:02.260 --> 00:14:03.380
Go!

00:14:04.300 --> 00:14:06.640
Goyo Lariat!

00:14:09.080 --> 00:14:10.890
I'm not done!

00:14:12.720 --> 00:14:15.140
When Goyo Guardian destroys your monster,

00:14:15.140 --> 00:14:21.140
it can negate its destruction 
and take control of it!

00:14:21.140 --> 00:14:23.970
When this happens, the monster 
is put in defense position!

00:14:24.410 --> 00:14:27.270
Your monster is mine!

00:14:29.300 --> 00:14:31.080
One minute forty seconds left!

00:14:31.150 --> 00:14:34.830
Yusei, hurry!  You're taking too much time!

00:14:36.810 --> 00:14:38.780
My Speed Counter is 4!

00:14:38.780 --> 00:14:41.210
Alright!  I'll keep piling it on!

00:14:41.210 --> 00:14:43.690
From my hand, I activate a Speed Spell!

00:14:43.690 --> 00:14:45.920
Sonic Buster!

00:14:50.960 --> 00:14:53.180
You used a Speed Spell.

00:14:53.180 --> 00:14:56.220
Of course.  I'm a D-Wheeler!

00:14:56.220 --> 00:14:59.920
This card deals damage to 
your life points equal to

00:14:59.920 --> 00:15:03.020
half the attack points of 
a monster on my field!

00:15:06.780 --> 00:15:11.840
In other words, you take half of 
Goyo Guardian's 2800 attack points,

00:15:11.840 --> 00:15:14.250
which is 1400 points of damage!

00:15:14.250 --> 00:15:18.990
Then I activate another 
Sonic Buster from my hand!

00:15:28.480 --> 00:15:30.570
This is bad.

00:15:31.720 --> 00:15:33.460
He's next to Yusei!

00:15:33.460 --> 00:15:37.830
Sucker!  You can't escape from here!

00:15:37.830 --> 00:15:42.520
Your garbage deck never had a 
chance of defeating my deck!

00:15:46.450 --> 00:15:49.260
You keep saying garbage over and over.

00:15:49.900 --> 00:15:51.830
Don't you know any other words?

00:15:51.830 --> 00:15:53.190
What?

00:15:54.990 --> 00:15:56.720
It's my turn!

00:15:58.080 --> 00:16:01.930
I summon the Tuner Monster Nitro Synchron!

00:16:06.970 --> 00:16:08.790
Another Tuner?

00:16:08.790 --> 00:16:13.560
You don't have a monster you can Synchro 
with.  Resistance is futile, you piece of garbage!

00:16:13.560 --> 00:16:16.950
I have one right there.

00:16:16.950 --> 00:16:20.250
I activate a Speed Spell!  Dash Pilfer!

00:16:22.010 --> 00:16:23.000
No way!

00:16:23.000 --> 00:16:26.930
You don't have any Speed Counters.  
How can you use a Speed Spell?

00:16:27.130 --> 00:16:29.300
I have Speed Counters.

00:16:29.740 --> 00:16:30.900
What!

00:16:35.350 --> 00:16:38.220
Slip Stream?

00:16:38.910 --> 00:16:41.340
I remember.  You planned this back then!

00:16:41.890 --> 00:16:44.290
Alright!  I'll keep piling it on!

00:16:44.290 --> 00:16:46.870
From my hand, I activate a Speed Spell!

00:16:46.870 --> 00:16:48.950
Sonic Buster!

00:16:51.610 --> 00:16:55.690
That Speed Spell was the trigger!

00:16:56.300 --> 00:17:00.290
That's right.  I was waiting 
for you to use a Speed Spell.

00:17:00.680 --> 00:17:04.870
When I have fewer 
Speed Counters than you, I can

00:17:04.870 --> 00:17:10.120
activate this Slip Stream card 
when you use a Speed Spell.

00:17:10.140 --> 00:17:15.390
On my next turn, I will have the same 
number of Speed Counters as you!

00:17:19.720 --> 00:17:24.480
You punk!  All you have are garbage cards 
and you still do such annoying things!

00:17:27.550 --> 00:17:31.020
Dash Pilfer!  Free Junk Warrior!

00:17:34.580 --> 00:17:36.060
Oh no!

00:17:36.490 --> 00:17:41.320
I can activate Dash Pilfer when I 
have four or more Speed Counters!

00:17:41.320 --> 00:17:46.180
I gain control of one of your 
face-up defense position monsters.

00:17:48.640 --> 00:17:49.940
This is bad.

00:17:49.940 --> 00:17:51.590
There's less than a minute.

00:17:51.590 --> 00:17:52.890
How about Yusei?

00:17:52.890 --> 00:17:56.450
A little more!  Just a little more and 
he can make it to the maintenance hatch!

00:18:00.680 --> 00:18:04.840
I see!  You're planning to go there!

00:18:05.450 --> 00:18:07.390
You finally noticed.

00:18:07.390 --> 00:18:09.590
Garbage is going to start flowing in soon.

00:18:09.590 --> 00:18:10.890
You can leave.

00:18:10.890 --> 00:18:12.600
You must be kidding!

00:18:12.600 --> 00:18:16.270
Are you now trying to goad me because 
you know you're going to lose?

00:18:18.360 --> 00:18:19.720
Here I go!

00:18:24.290 --> 00:18:26.460
Another Synchro Summon?

00:18:26.660 --> 00:18:30.100
Nitro Synchron tunes Junk Warrior.

00:18:31.260 --> 00:18:35.050
Our thoughts combine to 
call forth a new power!

00:18:35.050 --> 00:18:36.730
Become the path that lights the way!

00:18:37.160 --> 00:18:38.670
Synchro Summon!

00:18:39.160 --> 00:18:41.970
Burn up, Nitro Warrior!

00:18:45.060 --> 00:18:48.750
On the turn a Speed Spell was used,

00:18:48.750 --> 00:18:50.990
when Nitro Warrior battles your monster,

00:18:50.990 --> 00:18:53.570
it gains 1000 attack points for one time only.

00:18:53.570 --> 00:18:55.070
What?

00:18:58.080 --> 00:18:59.790
Nitro Warrior!

00:19:02.280 --> 00:19:04.020
Destroy him!

00:19:04.020 --> 00:19:06.390
Dynamite Knuckle!

00:19:09.890 --> 00:19:11.420
How dare you!

00:19:11.420 --> 00:19:13.100
Furthermore…

00:19:13.100 --> 00:19:17.240
With Nitro Warrior's monster effect,

00:19:17.240 --> 00:19:19.000
when it battles and destroys your monster,

00:19:19.000 --> 00:19:24.300
it can switch one of your defense position 
monsters into attack position and battle it.

00:19:25.200 --> 00:19:27.420
This monster effect is crazy!

00:19:27.420 --> 00:19:31.130
Nitro Warrior's attack points return to 2800,

00:19:31.440 --> 00:19:34.570
but that's more than enough to destroy Gate Blocker.

00:19:45.560 --> 00:19:47.190
Alright!

00:19:47.190 --> 00:19:48.400
He won the duel!

00:19:48.400 --> 00:19:50.830
But look at the time.

00:19:52.390 --> 00:19:53.870
Hurry, Yusei!

00:19:53.870 --> 00:19:56.100
The maintenance hatch is closing!

00:19:56.100 --> 00:19:57.800
Yusei!

00:20:30.620 --> 00:20:35.510
Remember this, I'll squash you next time!

00:20:35.970 --> 00:20:37.070
How's Yusei?

00:20:37.070 --> 00:20:39.410
It's no good.  There's no signal.

00:20:39.410 --> 00:20:42.480
He's fine!  Yusei definitely made it through!

00:20:42.480 --> 00:20:43.550
But!

00:20:55.060 --> 00:20:57.580
Like I thought, he made it!

00:20:58.940 --> 00:21:01.660
Yusei really made it through!

00:21:01.660 --> 00:21:03.830
Yeah!  He's incredible!

00:21:22.030 --> 00:21:23.300
Jack…

00:21:27.100 --> 00:21:30.100
Long time no see, Yusei.

00:22:03.540 --> 00:22:09.070
What can we grasp?  What can we do?

00:22:09.470 --> 00:22:14.480
We’ll step forward and find out

00:22:14.880 --> 00:22:20.420
My unstoppable emotions, the 
beating of my passionate heart

00:22:20.590 --> 00:22:25.660
I heard the voice of truth

00:22:25.860 --> 00:22:28.830
After I was hurt, I learned

00:22:31.400 --> 00:22:34.400
Of a place where I can become stronger

00:22:36.370 --> 00:22:41.570
I stack my dreams in my palm

00:22:41.710 --> 00:22:46.980
And I’ll someday pass them to you

00:22:47.410 --> 00:22:52.920
Seeking for the signal 
to start, my soul roars

00:22:53.220 --> 00:22:58.160
I will overcome my suffocating 
and mediocre life

00:22:58.790 --> 00:23:04.300
I’ll dash and acquire 
all the bright futures

00:23:04.460 --> 00:23:13.710
Carrying the bonds I believe 
in, I run towards tomorrow
